# libddb symbol manifest (XI-01): every function libddb exports whose name starts with DDB.
#
# Format: one symbol name per line, sorted in byte order (LC_ALL=C sort), no duplicates. Lines
# starting with '#' are comments; the '# abi MAJOR.MINOR' line must equal DDB_ABI_MAJOR and
# DDB_ABI_MINOR in ddb.h.
#
# This file is the only copy of the list. DDBGetCapabilities() returns it ("symbols", embedded by
# src/CMakeLists.txt) and every release publishes it next to ddb.h. scripts/check-abi.py (CI)
# fails when the library exports a different list, when the list changes without an ABI version
# bump since the previous release, and when a symbol is removed without a MAJOR bump.
# Adding an export: declare it in ddb.h, list it here, bump DDB_ABI_MINOR once per release.
#
# abi 1.1
